    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and collect <strong>Pondlings</strong> from unique, ambient fishing zones, with hundreds of quirky;<strong>\u00a0</strong>pattern, colour, and personality combinations to collect, name and care for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a <strong>Pondling-Tank</strong> that is truly <u>your own</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Catch</u>\u00a0</strong>Pondlings in a variety of <i>Unique</i>, and <i>Ambient</i> Locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/08ab7fc95858ca804196bc9b1075bafa.poster.avif?t=1755533615\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/08ab7fc95858ca804196bc9b1075bafa.webm?t=1755533615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Collect</u></strong> Pondlings of hundreds of possible colour and personality combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/b01bae39e603b9be0bb69e17608545e7.poster.avif?t=1755533615\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/b01bae39e603b9be0bb69e17608545e7.webm?t=1755533615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Decorate</strong></u> your tank with a variety of\u00a0<strong>backgrounds</strong>, <strong>flooring</strong> and <strong>decoration</strong> objects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/0f3eaef4fe8820f9ff3dfbea3a18f4e3.poster.avif?t=1755533615\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/0f3eaef4fe8820f9ff3dfbea3a18f4e3.webm?t=1755533615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Upgrade</u></strong>\u00a0your Fishing equipment to catch  difficult but valuable <strong>Pondlings</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlock</u></strong>\u00a0new <strong>Pond-Passes</strong>, for access to exciting, and peculiar fishing locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Share</u></strong> your carefully-considered <strong>tank</strong> with your <strong>friends</strong> on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Notice: Not all features listed will be currently present in any/all demo releases at any given time.)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and collect <strong>Pondlings</strong> from unique, ambient fishing zones, with hundreds of quirky;<strong>\u00a0</strong>pattern, colour, and personality combinations to collect, name and care for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a <strong>Pondling-Tank</strong> that is truly <u>your own</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Catch</u>\u00a0</strong>Pondlings in a variety of <i>Unique</i>, and <i>Ambient</i> Locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/08ab7fc95858ca804196bc9b1075bafa.poster.avif?t=1755533615\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/08ab7fc95858ca804196bc9b1075bafa.webm?t=1755533615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Collect</u></strong> Pondlings of hundreds of possible colour and personality combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/b01bae39e603b9be0bb69e17608545e7.poster.avif?t=1755533615\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/b01bae39e603b9be0bb69e17608545e7.webm?t=1755533615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Decorate</strong></u> your tank with a variety of\u00a0<strong>backgrounds</strong>, <strong>flooring</strong> and <strong>decoration</strong> objects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/0f3eaef4fe8820f9ff3dfbea3a18f4e3.poster.avif?t=1755533615\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/0f3eaef4fe8820f9ff3dfbea3a18f4e3.webm?t=1755533615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Upgrade</u></strong>\u00a0your Fishing equipment to catch  difficult but valuable <strong>Pondlings</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlock</u></strong>\u00a0new <strong>Pond-Passes</strong>, for access to exciting, and peculiar fishing locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Share</u></strong> your carefully-considered <strong>tank</strong> with your <strong>friends</strong> on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Notice: Not all features listed will be currently present in any/all demo releases at any given time.)</p>",
